#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Smart workspace auto-categorization daemon for Hyprland.

Listens for new windows and automatically moves them to the right workspace
based on intelligent keyword matching on window class, title, and process name.
Learns unknown apps and caches decisions for instant recall.

Works with split-monitor-workspaces plugin (5 per monitor):
  Laptop (eDP-1): WS 1-5   →  L1=Dev, L2=Chat, L3=Work, L4=Games, L5=System
  TV (HDMI-A-1):  WS 6-10  →  T1=Web, T2=Media, T3=Reference, T4=Files, T5=Extra

Usage: hypr-smart-workspace  (runs as daemon)
"""

